<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh copper production rose 37.4 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Kazakh copper production rose 37.4 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakh copper output rose by 37.4 percent in October over the previous month, zinc output rose by 5.7 percent and lead production rose by 15.6 percent in the same period, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It gave the following figures for non-ferrous metal production (all figures in tonnes) -</p>
<p>					 Oct	 Sep	Jan-Oct96</p>
<p> Copper				17,649    12,843     226,450</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	    +37.4     -36.8	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	    -20.1     -39.6	  +9.6</p>
<p> Zinc				  15,307    14,485     139,392</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	     +5.7	+3.7	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	    +26.5	+9.3	  -2.3</p>
<p> Lead				   5,356     4,633	55,063</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	    +15.6     -28.6	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	    -24.9	+4.7	 -31.0</p>
<p> Bauxite			    280,000   291,600   2,773,100</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	     -4.0	-7.1	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	     +6.6	-1.1	  +1.2</p>
<p> Alumina			     94,049    91,020     898,475</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	     +3.3	+3.2	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	     +6.5	+6.8	  +6.6</p>
<p> Titanium			     1,137     1,066	10,007</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	     +6.7	+1.1	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	    +23.6     +24.8	 +29.8</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom +7 327 509410</p>
